<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/agentrole.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                              dcterms:description "Represents an agent playing a role in some context. Agents can be persons, organizations, or software agents."^^xsd:string ;
                                                              dcterms:title "Agent Role Pattern"^^xsd:string ;
                                                              rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x2; term declared x2;
